              fixedCode: "- name: Copy config\n  copy:\n    src: nginx.conf\n    dest: /etc/nginx/nginx.conf\n  notify: Restart nginx\nhandlers:\n  - name: Restart nginx\n    service:\n      name: nginx\n      state: restarted",
              explanation: "Restarting unconditionally on every run breaks idempotency and causes needless downtime; a handler restarts only when the config actually changed."
